Z||000003||ounmongk||05-18-2000||03:30 AM||||The Fiero Store sells conversions, I think from the sealed beam headlight to a bulb-type setup. (they come with those super/hyper- white bulbs) But that doesn't really answer your question, does it?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>...Yes, you need to get a new headlamp...||||reg||1
Z||000004||Carrolles||05-18-2000||01:43 PM||||I replaced the sealed beams in mine with the HV units I got at Walmart.  I paid around $19.00 for a two pack.  Quite a bit brighter than stock beams.||||reg||1
